<https://example.org/birds/vocab/taxon/aquila-adalberti> bird:account "A large, dark eagle with white shoulders, found only in the Iberian Peninsula. It hunts rabbits, so the rabbit diseases myxomatosis and haemorrhagic disease reduced its food. Electrocution on power lines and poison baits killed many birds. Protection of nests and the insulation of power lines have increased the population to several hundred pairs."@en ;
