<https://example.org/birds/vocab/taxon/coracias-caudatus> bird:account "A colourful roller with a lilac throat and breast, turquoise belly and long outer tail streamers. It perches on bare branches and posts in open savanna and drops on insects and lizards. In the breeding season it rolls and dives in display flights."@en ;
