<https://example.org/birds/vocab/taxon/diomedea-epomophora> bird:account "One of the largest seabirds, with a wingspan of about three metres. Most breed on Campbell Island, and a small colony breeds on the mainland at Taiaroa Head on the Otago Peninsula. A pair raises one chick every two years. Between breeding attempts, birds circle the Southern Ocean and feed off the coasts of Chile and Argentina."@en ;
