<https://example.org/birds/vocab/taxon/erithacus-rubecula> bird:account "A small, round bird with an orange-red face and breast. In Britain it is tame and follows gardeners for worms, but on the continent it is a shy woodland bird. Both sexes sing and hold territories in winter. Many birds from northern and eastern Europe migrate to the Mediterranean in autumn."@en ;
