<https://example.org/birds/vocab/taxon/falco-novaeseelandiae> bird:account "A small, fast falcon that hunts birds in flight through forest and over open hill country. It is dark brown above with a streaked buff breast and rufous thighs. It nests on ledges, in trees and on the ground in pine plantations, which now hold a large part of the population. It defends its nest fiercely against people."@en ;
