<https://example.org/birds/vocab/taxon/lamprotornis-superbus> bird:account "A starling with glossy blue-green upperparts, a chestnut belly, a white band across the breast and pale eyes. It is common and bold in the dry savanna and tourist camps of East Africa. It breeds cooperatively: helpers bring food to the chicks of the dominant pair."@en ;
