<https://example.org/birds/vocab/taxon/parus-major> bird:account "The largest tit in Europe, with a black head, white cheeks and a yellow breast with a black central stripe. Its song is a loud 'teacher, teacher'. It is one of the most studied birds in the world: long-term studies at Wytham Woods near Oxford have tracked its breeding since 1947."@en ;
