<https://example.org/birds/vocab/taxon/passer-domesticus> bird:account "A small, stocky sparrow that lives close to people. The male has a grey crown, chestnut nape and a black bib, and the female is plain brown. It has followed people around the world, but in many European cities its numbers have fallen sharply, for reasons that are not fully known."@en ;
