<https://example.org/birds/vocab/taxon/phoenicopterus-chilensis> bird:account "A pink flamingo with greyish legs and pink knees. It lives on salt lakes and lagoons of temperate South America, from the high Andes to the coasts of Argentina, Chile and Uruguay. It feeds by filtering small invertebrates from mud. Its colonies move from year to year as water levels change."@en ;
