<https://example.org/birds/vocab/taxon/phoenicopterus-roseus> bird:account "A tall pink-white flamingo with a pink bill tipped with black and bright red and black wings in flight. It filters small shrimp and algae from salt lagoons with its head held upside down. It breeds in large colonies in a few places, such as Fuente de Piedra in Spain and the Camargue in France."@en ;
