<https://example.org/birds/vocab/taxon/ptilonorhynchus-violaceus> bird:account "A stocky bowerbird. The adult male is glossy blue-black with violet eyes. He builds an avenue of sticks on the forest floor and decorates it with blue objects: feathers, flowers and, near people, bottle caps and pegs. He paints the inner walls with chewed plant matter. Females visit several bowers before they choose a mate."@en ;
