<https://example.org/birds/vocab/taxon/sagittarius-serpentarius> bird:account "A tall, long-legged bird of prey of African grassland, with a crest of long black feathers like quill pens behind the head. It walks up to 30 km a day and kills snakes, lizards and rodents with fast, accurate kicks. It appears on the coat of arms of South Africa and Sudan."@en ;
