<https://example.org/birds/vocab/taxon/spheniscus-magellanicus> bird:account "A black and white penguin with two black bands across the breast. It breeds in burrows and under bushes in large colonies on the coasts of Argentina, Chile and the Falkland Islands, such as Punta Tombo. In winter it migrates north along the coasts of Brazil and Peru."@en ;
